notes = "(!) The BIOS for the selected Video Standard core option is required: cdi200.rom for NTSC (default), cdi220b.rom for PAL.|(!) cdi200.rom (md5): 2969341396aa61e0143dc2351aaa6ef6|(!) cdi220b.rom (md5): ac0d468be366779c9df633be98da250a|(!) vmpega.rom (md5): 53ba3bf7443187a657baa272d01d3771|Without vmpega.rom the player has no Digital Video Cartridge."

description = "zcdi emulates the Philips CD-i Mono-I board (SCC68070 CPU, MCD212 video, CDIC disc and audio controller) and the optional 22ER9141 Digital Video Cartridge. It runs the original BIOS and cartridge firmware, and reads CHD and CUE/BIN disc images, and M3U playlists for multi-disc titles."
